Subject: [PATCH] Preserve a known access profile identity during updates

Preserve only access_profile.id, not mutable computed fields such as updated_at.
Use the framework's non-null modifier so creation, unknown prior identity, and
null prior identity remain unresolved. TestAccessProfileMetadataIdentityPlan
exercises the registered resource and an unpatched schema control through the
public planning protocol, including downstream visibility-binding replacement.

--- a/internal/provider/access_profile_resource.go
+++ b/internal/provider/access_profile_resource.go
@@ -102,6 +102,9 @@
 			},
 			"id": schema.StringAttribute{
-				Computed:    true,
+				Computed: true,
+				PlanModifiers: []planmodifier.String{
+					stringplanmodifier.UseNonNullStateForUnknown(),
+				},
 				Description: `The id of the request catalog.`,
 			},
 			"published": schema.BoolAttribute{
